22:["$","section",null,{"id":"cost","data-reveal":true,"className":"scroll-mt-24 border-b-hairline-soft py-20","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-label uppercase text-fg-muted [letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label)]","children":"Cost & engagement"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-4 max-w-[26ch] font-display text-display-l font-extrabold text-fg [text-wrap:balance]","children":"Measurable SEO — and our AI Writer from $250 USD/month."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-8 font-mono text-body text-fg-secondary","children":"No vanity metrics, no black box. Our Agentic AI Writer starts at $250 USD per month and delivers visible organic traffic with measurable results in Google Search Console from the very first month. Broader SEO is scoped to your market — most engagements are a monthly retainer because SEO compounds (it keeps paying after you stop, unlike ads), plus one-time audits and SEO consulting services. It's professional SEO at affordable nearshore rates — without a US agency price tag. Either way, you see the keywords, the work, and the rankings."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-10 rounded-xl border-hairline bg-white/[0.015] p-6 sm:p-8","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-label-s uppercase text-accent [letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label-tight)]","children":"Owned, not rented · future-proofed"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 font-mono text-body text-fg-secondary","children":"Ads stop the moment the budget does; SEO keeps working. We target real demand, report transparently, and build in GEO/AEO — so your visibility grows AND survives the shift to AI search."}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"data-reveal-stagger":true,"className":"mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3","children":[["$","li","Agentic AI Writer",{"className":"flex flex-col rounded-xl border p-6 border-accent/30 bg-accent/[0.03]","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-label-s uppercase [letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label-tight)] text-accent","ch