24:["$","$L3d",null,{"faqs":[{"question":"What are SEO services, and what do they include?","answer":"Professional SEO services earn your business organic visibility in search. A full-service SEO company typically includes technical SEO (site health, speed, structured data), on-page and content (keyword-mapped pages that rank), local SEO (Google Business Profile, 'near me'), link building, and SEO consulting. We also include GEO/AEO — getting cited by AI search engines — which most agencies don't offer yet."},{"question":"What is GEO / AEO, and why do I need it now?","answer":"GEO (generative engine optimization) and AEO (answer engine optimization) get your business cited by ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Google's AI answers. Search is shifting from ten blue links to AI giving one answer and citing a few sources. Ranking #1 on Google no longer guarantees you're seen — you also have to be in the AI's answer. We do both."},{"question":"How long does SEO take to work?","answer":"Local and technical wins can show in weeks; competitive organic rankings typically take a few months to build and then compound. SEO is an investment that keeps paying after you stop spending — unlike ads. We report transparently every month so you see the progress, not just the bill."},{"question":"How much do SEO services cost?","answer":"It depends on competitiveness and scope. Our Agentic AI Writer starts at $250 USD/month; senior SEO work starts at $50 USD/hour. Most engagements are a monthly retainer because SEO compounds, and we also offer one-time audits. We scope it up front so you see what you're paying for — and we report the keywords and rankings, no black box."},{"question":"Do you do local SEO for Monterrey, Texas, or 'near me' searches?","answer":"Yes — local is our biggest strength. We optimize Google Business Profiles, local citations, and 'near me' visibility for Monterrey, Texas, and anywhere your customers search. Local SEO is where the highest-intent, highest-converting searches live for most businesses."},{"question":"Can you guarantee #1 rankings?","answer":"No honest SEO can — Google's ranking is theirs to decide, and anyone promising guaranteed #1 is selling snake oil. What we guarantee is white-hat work, transparency, and a strategy tied to real demand and outcomes. The best SEO company isn't the one with the biggest promise — it's the one whose own results you can verify. The proof is this site: you found it because our SEO works."}],"id":"faq","title":"What teams ask before hiring for SEO.","fill":true}]
25:["$","section",null,{"data-reveal":true,"className":"border-b-hairline-soft py-20","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-label uppercase text-fg-muted [letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label)]","children":"Related services"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-4 font-display text-display-m font-bold text-fg","children":"Often paired with SEO"}],["$","ul",null,{"data-reveal-stagger":true,"className":"mt-8 flex flex-col gap-4","children":[["$","li","paid-media",{"children":"$L3e"}],["$","li","generative-engine-optimization",{"children":"$L3f"}],["$","li","web-development",{"children":"$L40"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-20 font-mono text-label uppercase text-fg-muted [letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label)]","children":"Learn more"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-4 font-display text-display-m font-bold text-fg","children":"From the blog"}],["$","$L41",null,{"posts":[{"title":"Ecommerce SEO: ranking product pages that sell","slug":"ecommerce-seo","category":"Guide","excerpt":"Ecommerce SEO is how product and category pages earn organic traffic that converts. Here's how to rank product pages that sell — keyword intent, technical fixes, content, and the AI-search layer most stores still ignore.","readMin":6,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/seo-ecommerce-boutique.webp","imageAlt":"Small business owner packing online orders in a shop, illustrating ecommerce SEO for product pages"},{"title":"Enterprise SEO: scaling organic across thousands of pages","slug":"enterprise-seo","category":"Guide","excerpt":"Enterprise SEO is the practice of growing organic traffic across very large sites — thousands or millions of pages — where templates, crawl budget, and internal process matter more than one-off page tweaks. Here's how it works, where it differs from regular SEO, and how to scale it.","readMin":6,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/seo-enterprise-team.webp","imageAlt":"Large marketing team in a boardroom, illustrating enterprise SEO across thousands of pages"},{"title":"How long does SEO take to work?","slug":"how-long-does-seo-take","category":"Guide","excerpt":"How long does SEO take to work? For most US businesses, expect 3-6 months for early movement and 6-12 months for meaningful traffic and rankings. Here's the realistic timeline, what drives it, and how to spot progress before the rankings land.","readMin":5,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/seo-howlong-seedling.webp","imageAlt":"Hands cupping a growing seedling, a metaphor for how long SEO takes to work"},{"title":"How to choose an SEO agency (avoid the snake oil)","slug":"how-to-choose-an-seo-agency","category":"Guide","excerpt":"How to choose an SEO agency without getting burned: the questions to ask, the red flags that signal snake oil, and the criteria that separate a real partner from a retainer that quietly drains your budget.","readMin":7,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/seo-choose-agency-handshake.webp","imageAlt":"Two professionals shaking hands, choosing the right SEO agency partner"},{"title":"Local SEO: the complete guide (Monterrey / Texas)","slug":"local-seo-complete-guide","category":"Guide","excerpt":"Local SEO services help a business rank in Google's map pack and 'near me' searches for the towns it actually serves. Here's the complete local SEO playbook for Monterrey and Texas businesses — Google Business Profile, citations, reviews, and on-page geo signals.","readMin":7,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/seo-local-storefront.webp","imageAlt":"Proud local shop owner in their storefront doorway, illustrating local SEO for Monterrey and Texas"},{"title":"Technical SEO checklist (2026)","slug":"technical-seo-checklist-2026","category":"Guide","excerpt":"A practical technical SEO checklist for 2026 — crawlability, indexation, Core Web Vitals, structured data, and the AI-search basics that decide whether Google ranks you and AI engines cite you.","readMin":6,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/seo-technical-keyboard.webp","imageAlt":"Developer's hands on a backlit mechanical keyboard, working through a technical SEO checklist"}],"className":"mt-8"}]]}]
